      "kind": "asset",
      "extracted_text": "Azure Architecture Icons usage notice\n\nOfficial catalog: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/architecture/icons/\nOfficial archive: https://arch-center.azureedge.net/icons/Azure_Public_Service_Icons_V24.zip\nArchive version: V24\nArchive SHA-256: 921594ccd1bf3d9c0a1bd7b6d924e050551a59342f2b353bb74bdcf761c35141\nArchive file date: 2026-07-08\nTerms verified: 2026-08-29\n\nSelected Microsoft Azure service icons are embedded only to identify real\nAzure services in Rootform architecture diagrams. Microsoft_Terms_of_Use.pdf\nfrom the official archive permits copying, distributing, and displaying these\nicons in architectural diagrams, training materials, and documentation.\n\nRootform preserves icon appearance. It does not crop, flip, rotate, distort,\nchange icon shape, or use an Azure icon as Rootform product identity. Rootform\nis not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Microsoft.\n\nMicrosoft and Azure are trademarks of the Microsoft group of companies.\nSee the official archive and catalog page for complete current terms.\n",
